    <string name="phone_test_started">The stock ECARX service was asked to retain the already paired iPhone. Status Widget v2 is draining the exact current BLE owner and starting a fresh generation in the selected topology; it does not refresh hidden GATT caches, cycle Bluetooth, or delete the bond. Keep Helper running and the iPhone unlocked while the authorization and ANCS subscriptions complete. If iOS denies ANCS, check “Show Notifications” for the head unit in iPhone Bluetooth settings.</string>
    <string name="phone_privacy_hint">ANCS and device-qualified MAP data come only from the selected iPhone over Bluetooth and require neither Android Notification Access nor access to the shared Android SMS inbox. The exact Bluetooth address stays on this head unit and is shown here only in masked form.</string>
